    "fields": {
        "blockTitle": "A title for this block",
        "text": "<p>We help organisations tell their story online. <strong>Clear content</strong>, <em>a strong design</em> and a site that is easy to manage: that is what we build, together with <a href=\"https://www.thekindkids.be\">The Kind Kids</a>.</p>",
